      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Missense mutations in genes involved in familial hemophagocytic lymphohistiocytosis can delay the onset of this life-threatening disease. In children and adults, early recognition of aspecific features as neurological symptoms is crucial as urgent treatment is required."},
